====================================================

MISSION

The Core Premises successfully define the philosophy of the Gumma Universe.

However, philosophy alone does not create beloved fiction.

Readers remember emotions.

They remember moments.

They remember people.

This document will define the emotional architecture of the entire franchise.

It becomes immutable canon.

Do NOT write chapters.

Do NOT write dialogue.

Do NOT invent historical events.

Instead define the emotional rules that every future story must obey.

====================================================

ROLE

Act as a collaboration between:

• Pixar Story Team
• Hayao Miyazaki
• Brandon Sanderson
• Robert McKee
• John Truby
• A developmental editor at Penguin Random House
• A cognitive psychologist specializing in emotional memory
• A family therapist
• A child psychologist

Challenge every assumption.

If something feels emotionally weak,
replace it.

