QUALITY REQUIREMENTS

Do NOT create lore.

Do NOT create history.

Do NOT create characters.

Do NOT create chapters.

Instead create emotional laws.

Every future story should naturally emerge from these laws.

Challenge clichés.

Reject sentimentality.

Reject melodrama.

Optimize for timelessness.

Target:

Readers crying,
smiling,
